# Vulnerabilities accepted after review. Revisit when upgrading to Spring Framework 7.

# spring-webmvc: RCE via improper path limitation in XsltView.
# Only fixed in Spring 7.0.9 (no Spring 6.x fix). This app does not use XsltView
# (views are JSPs via InternalResourceViewResolver), so the vulnerable code path is unreachable.
# Reviewed: 2026-11-06
CVE-2026-47884

# spring-webmvc/spring-webflux: stream corruption in Server-Sent Events (SSE) with view rendering.
# Only fixed in Spring 7.0.9 (no Spring 6.x fix). This app has no SSE endpoints
# (no SseEmitter / ResponseBodyEmitter / text/event-stream / WebFlux), so it is not exposed.
# Reviewed: 2026-11-06
CVE-2026-47890
